    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Alura Teak Wood Floor Mirror | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Alura teak wood floor mirror by Kave Home, selected by KASODI for its organic silhouette, warm natural wood and sculptural presence."
    />
    <style>
  .product-detail-image img {
    aspect-ratio: auto !important;
    object-fit: contain !important;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
</style>
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <a href="/home-decor">Home Decor</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <span>Alura Teak Wood Floor Mirror</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/home-decor/kave-home-alura-teak-wood-floor-mirror.png"
            alt="Alura teak wood floor mirror by Kave Home styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT &middot; MIRRORS
          </p>

          <h1>
            Alura Teak Wood Floor Mirror
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Kave Home
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A full-length mirror framed in warm teak wood, defined by an
            asymmetric organic silhouette that softens its generous scale.
            Alura works as both a practical mirror and a sculptural interior
            element, bringing natural warmth and character to a room.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Glass &middot; Teak wood</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>94.5 &times; 192 &times; 3.2 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Natural brown</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Shape</span>
              <strong>Free form</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Wood</span>
              <strong>FSC&trade; 100%</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Use</span>
              <strong>Indoor</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/alura-teak-wood-mirror-946-x-1921cm-fsc-100?utm_affaid=kasodi"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here &rarr;
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Alura has the presence of a large statement mirror without the
            formality of a conventional rectangular frame. Its gently irregular
            outline introduces movement, while the teak wood adds warmth and
            makes such a substantial piece feel softer in the room.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like it against warm plaster walls, beside linen
            curtains or surrounded by stone, ceramics and natural fibres.
            Because wood is a natural material, variations in tone give each
            piece its own character.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Care for the natural finish</h2>

        <p>
          Clean with a damp cloth and a mild cleaner, then dry immediately.
          Dust regularly and keep the mirror away from direct sources of heat
          and prolonged direct sunlight. Avoid abrasive products, bleach,
          acetone and solvents.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Textured Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Soft ivory or oatmeal linen curtains balance the scale of the
              mirror and complement the warmth of its teak frame.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Natural Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              A large handmade ceramic vessel introduces another organic
              material without competing with the mirror's silhouette.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Woven Textures</h3>
            <p>
              Jute, wool and other natural fibres reinforce the relaxed,
              tactile character of the teak wood.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>HOME DECOR</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/home-decor/lurea-sculptural-glass-centrepiece"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-decor/kave-home-lurea-sculptural-glass-centrepiece.png"
                alt="Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/home-decor/drava-burgundy-ceramic-table-lamp"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-decor/kave-home-drava-burgundy-ceramic-table-lamp.png"
                alt="Drava Burgundy Ceramic Table Lamp"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>LIGHTING</span>
              <h3>Drava Burgundy Ceramic Table Lamp</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/interesting-finds/serela-white-marble-bookends"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/interesting-finds/kave-home-serela-white-marble-bookends.png"
                alt="Serela White Marble Bookends"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Serela White Marble Bookends</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          KAVE HOME &middot; TEAK WOOD
        </p>

        <h2>
          An organic reflection framed in natural warmth.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/alura-teak-wood-mirror-946-x-1921cm-fsc-100?utm_affaid=kasodi"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here &rarr;
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>